---
import catalog from '../../../data/martin/index.mjs';

const appendix = catalog.parts[6].units[3];
---

<nav class="appendix-contents" aria-labelledby="appendix-d-contents-title">
  <h2 id="appendix-d-contents-title">附录目录 | Appendix contents</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><a href="#reference-orientation">使用定位 | Reference orientation</a></li>
    <li><a href="#source-map">来源地图 | Source map</a></li>
    <li><a href="#objects-and-conventions">对象、单位与响应约定 | Objects, units, and response conventions</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-d-1">D.1 微扰理论 | Perturbation theory</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-d-2">D.2 静态响应函数 | Static response functions</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-d-3">D.3 自洽场响应 | Response in self-consistent field theories</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-d-4">D.4 动态响应与 Kramers–Kronig | Dynamic response and Kramers–Kronig</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-d-5">D.5 Green 函数 | Green’s functions</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-d-6">D.6 2n+1 定理 | The 2n+1 theorem</a></li>
    <li><a href="#review">交叉引用、误判、练习与来源 | Review and sources</a></li>
  </ol>
</nav>

<section id="source-map" class="chapter-source-map" aria-labelledby="appendix-d-source-title">
  <h2 id="appendix-d-source-title">来源地图 | Source map</h2>
  <p>
    下表记录 Martin Appendix D 的目录标题和印刷页定位。网站正文、补充推导、图形和练习均为原创，不转录教材正文、原图或习题。
  </p>
  <p lang="en">
    The table records Martin Appendix D directory titles and printed-page locators. Website prose, supplemental derivations, diagrams, and exercises are original and do not reproduce textbook prose, figures, or exercises.
  </p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>原书位置 | Source locator</th>
        <th>原节标题 | Source section</th>
        <th>网站覆盖 | Website coverage</th>
        <th>状态 | State</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {appendix.sections.map((section) => (
        <tr>
          <td>{section.id}, printed p. {section.page}</td>
          <td>{section.title}</td>
          <td>
            {section.id === 'D.1'
              ? '一阶态修正、observable 响应、占据/空态求和和简并边界'
              : section.id === 'D.2'
                ? '静态密度响应、Fourier 分量、独立粒子 susceptibility'
                : section.id === 'D.3'
                  ? '外场、有效场、kernel、Dyson 方程、逆响应和 RPA'
                  : section.id === 'D.4'
                    ? '阻尼谐振子、因果性、频域解析性、KK、Kubo–Greenwood 和动态 kernel'
                    : section.id === 'D.5'
                      ? 'resolvent、谱表示、DOS、density matrix、轮廓积分和局域性'
                      : '阶次展开、归一化约束、变分消元与三阶能量'}
          </td>
          <td>source mapped; substantive drafting</td>
        </tr>
      ))}
      <tr>
        <td>Exercises, printed p. {appendix.exercisesPage}</td>
        <td>Source exercises not reproduced</td>
        <td>原创微扰、因果、轮廓积分和阶次验证练习 | Original perturbation, causality, contour, and order-checking exercises</td>
        <td>original replacement planned</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

<style>
  .appendix-contents {
    margin-block: 1.5rem 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    border-radius: 0.65rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-7);
  }

  .appendix-contents h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .appendix-contents ol {
    columns: 2;
    column-gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .appendix-contents li {
    break-inside: avoid;
    margin-block: 0.35rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 50rem) {
    .appendix-contents ol {
      columns: 1;
    }
  }
</style>
